#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:0
msgid ""
"Reconfigure Ubuntu Desktop to follow the LTS or interim release upgrade "
"path, and learn how the two release types differ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:7
msgid "Topics: Updates Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:11
msgid "Switch between an LTS and interim release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:13
msgid ""
"Ubuntu releases come in two types with different life cycles: Long Term "
"Support (LTS) releases and interim releases. You can reconfigure your system "
"from one type to another."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:15
msgid "The difference between release types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:17
msgid ""
"LTS releases such as Ubuntu 26.04 LTS are recommended for users looking for "
"a stable environment. LTS releases receive five years of support and "
"security updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:19
msgid ""
"Interim releases are supported for nine months. They give you a chance to "
"preview new features and updates ahead of the next LTS release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:21
msgid ""
"To learn more about the life cycle of Ubuntu releases, see [The Ubuntu "
"lifecycle and release cadence](https://ubuntu.com/about/release-cycle)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:24
msgid ""
"To extend the support lifetime of your Ubuntu LTS system, consider enabling "
"[Ubuntu Pro](https://ubuntu.com/pro) in the Security Center. You also "
"receive security updates to community-maintained packages and get access to "
"certain enterprise features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:26
msgid "Ubuntu Pro is free for personal use on up to 5 machines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:30
msgid "Determine your current release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:32
msgid ""
"Before you start upgrading, you need to know which version of Ubuntu you're "
"currently using and whether it's an LTS or interim release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:0
msgid "Graphical interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:38
msgid ""
"On Ubuntu Desktop, open the Settings application. Navigate to {menuselection}"
"`System --> About`. Your Ubuntu version is listed in the {guilabel}"
"`Operating System` field. For example, it might say \"Ubuntu 26.04 LTS\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:40
msgid ""
"On earlier Ubuntu versions, the information was located on the Details tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:0
msgid "Command line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:-1
msgid "Description:\tUbuntu 26.04 LTS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:59
msgid "Switch to interim"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:61
msgid ""
"If you're currently using an LTS release such as Ubuntu 26.04 LTS, you can "
"configure your system to follow interim releases instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:67
#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:100
msgid ""
"Install the Software & Updates application, which is available from the "
"`software-properties-gtk` Deb package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:69
#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:102
msgid "Open the Software & Updates application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:71
#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:104
msgid "Go to the {guilabel}`Updates` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:73
msgid ""
"In the menu labeled {guilabel}`Notify me of a new Ubuntu version`, select "
"{guilabel}`For any new version`, which includes interim releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:75
#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:108
msgid "Close the application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:81
#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:114
msgid "Edit the `/etc/update-manager/release-upgrades` configuration file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:82
msgid "Set the `Prompt=normal` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:85
msgid ""
"An upgrade to an interim release becomes available now, unless you're using "
"an LTS release that's just come out and there's no recent interim release "
"yet. Follow the instructions in the {ref}`Upgrade Ubuntu Desktop <upgrade-"
"ubuntu-desktop>` guide. You might have to upgrade several times until you "
"reach the latest interim release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:89
msgid "Switch to LTS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:91
msgid ""
"If you're using an interim release of Ubuntu, you can reconfigure your "
"system to be an LTS release. However, you can only do this at certain points "
"in time:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:93
msgid ""
"When you're using an interim release that directly precedes an LTS release, "
"such as on Ubuntu 25.10 before Ubuntu 26.04 LTS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:94
msgid ""
"When you upgrade to an Ubuntu release that's an LTS release, such as after "
"your upgrade to Ubuntu 26.04 LTS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:106
msgid ""
"In the menu labeled {guilabel}`Notify me of a new Ubuntu version`, select "
"{guilabel}`For long-term support versions`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:115
msgid "Set the `Prompt=lts` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/switch-between-an-lts-and-interim-release.md:118
msgid ""
"Your installation now stops offering upgrades to new interim releases, and "
"instead, it stabilizes on the current or upcoming LTS release. When a new "
"LTS release becomes available, follow the instructions in the {ref}`Upgrade "
"Ubuntu Desktop <upgrade-ubuntu-desktop>` guide to upgrade your system."
msgstr ""
